Cell["\<\
This applet shows linear combinations of three vectors {u,v,w} in the vector \
space C[0,1], which consists of the continuous real functions on the interval \
[0,1]. The scalars in the linear combination iu+jv+kw are i, j, and k. They \
lie in the field R and can be varied using the sliders.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.8424486554794083`*^9, 3.842448830415403*^9}, {
  3.842448876023294*^9, 
  3.842448916727746*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"11b42a03-3b99-4455-940b-\
86a0b06c5223"]
